# Where each MXML source in this directory came from.
#
# The two grids are structural forks of vanilla files: compare against the
# vanilla file at the same UI/ path to see the change.
#
# The rest are new files the mod adds under UI/BIGGERITEMGRIDS. Each one
# started as the vanilla file in the middle column, with small value
# changes on top (slot and box sizes, template references). They are
# stored whole because the AMUMSS pipeline cannot apply value patches
# while creating a new file - a new file's content must be complete.
#
# All files below were decompiled from the mod's previous binary
# sources with the repo's MBINCompiler-linux, and round-trip
# byte-identically (MXML -> MBIN -> MXML). To re-derive after a game
# update: decompile the new vanilla file and the new mod file, diff
# them, and store the new mod MXML here.
#
# file                          derived from vanilla file
INVENTORYPAGE.MXML              UI/INVENTORYPAGE.MBIN (patched values, same path)
POPUP_BUILD.MXML                UI/POPUP_BUILD.MBIN (patched values, same path)
POPUP_INVENTORY.MXML            UI/POPUP_INVENTORY.MBIN (structural fork)
POPUP_TRANSFER.MXML             UI/POPUP_TRANSFER.MBIN (patched values, same path)
ROCKETLOCKERPAGE.MXML           UI/ROCKETLOCKERPAGE.MBIN (patched values, same path)
